{"id":"46b69a8f-76cc-40e6-8d0c-02798978a469","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:17:55.073Z","batchId":"profile_qwen3-8-flash-opencode-go_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"profile","prompt":"A user profile card with avatar, name, role, short bio, a few stats and a follow button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 480px; width: 100%;\">\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n        <!-- Header row with avatar and follow -->\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items: flex-start;\">\n          <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items: center;\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 28px;\">MK</div>\n            <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n              <h2 style=\"margin: 0;\">Mira Kowalski</h2>\n              <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Senior Product Designer</p>\n              <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n                <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Design Systems</span>\n                <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Remote</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Bio -->\n        <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n          I craft design systems and interaction patterns that scale across products. Previously shaped the component libraries at Stripe and Figma. Passionate about accessibility, typography, and the quiet details that make software feel inevitable.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Stats row -->\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content: space-between; text-align: center; gap: 8px;\">\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">12.4k</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Followers</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">384</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Following</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">97</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Projects</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"flex: 1;\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">4.9</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Rating</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n        <!-- Action buttons -->\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-block\" id=\"follow-btn\" onclick=\"toggleFollow()\">Follow</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Message</button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Activity summary -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h4 class=\"card-title\">Recent Activity</h4>\n      <table>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Published <strong>Aperture UI Kit v3</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">2d ago</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Released token spec for <strong>Nebula DS</strong></td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">5d ago</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Spoke at <strong>Config 2026</strong> — \"Scaling without Stalling\"</td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">1w ago</span></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n